Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 15:50:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(Core/Spells): MOD_STAT_OF_ARMOR aura - armor-scaled base
 stats (F-188)

New custom aura SPELL_AURA_MOD_STAT_OF_ARMOR (317, TOTAL_AURAS 317->318): a base
stat (MiscValue = Stats enum) gains 1 point per (base+die) armor. Extends the
F-188 stat-scaling concept from the SCHOOL_DAMAGE path to the stat pipeline.

- Computed live in Unit::GetTotalStatValue (armor / amount).
- Player::UpdateArmor re-runs UpdateStats so it tracks armor changes and
  cascades to AP / block value. Auto-refresh limited to STR/STA/SPI; AGI/INT
  re-enter UpdateArmor (agi gives armor; int via MOD_RESISTANCE_OF_INTELLECT_PERCENT)
  so they would loop.
- Handler in SpellAuraEffects.cpp; declared in SpellAuraEffects.h.

First consumer: Ironhide (900192-194) reworked from aura-285 AP-of-armor
to Strength-of-armor (150/100/50 armor per Str). Reusable for any base stat.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFCGguUqQdgNM386i4SDxQ
